Mug is just going to be a dead simple app, a toolbar app, macOS, Swift, and it keeps the computer awake. That's it. And it will have options for infinite, 5 minutes, 10, 15, things like that. Really simple. And the toolbar icon should just be like a simple white mug. When it's active, the mug has a little bit of steam. When it's not, it's empty. 

